  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promote Community Lead Total Sanitation (CLTS) in Five Villages In Kpandobu Section</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aim to contribute to one of CAFOD&#x2019;s thematic areas Sanitation focusing on the Community Lead Total Sanitation (CLTS). Missionary Sisters of our lady of the Holy Rosary (MSHR) will be working in collaboration with the community Artisan who were selected and trained in these subproject communities to provide technical workmanship in the construction 87 Household Latrines.</narrative>
